          "title": "Consumer Insights Manager",
          "job_title_raw": "Consumer Insights Manager",
          "description": "<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin:0in\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif;color:black\">About Us:</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Trilliant Food & Nutrition is a leading <span style=\"color:black;background:white\">manufacturer of premium coffees and powdered beverages, proudly headquartered in Little Chute, Wisconsin. With a legacy rooted in quality, innovation, and service, Trilliant delivers branded and private label solutions across retail, foodservice, and e-commerce channels.  </span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif;background:white\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Horseshoe Beverage Company, based in Neenah, WI, is a leading ready-to-drink beverage manufacturer dedicated to delivering an exceptional beverage experience. By combining industry-leading talent and cutting-edge equipment, we drive innovation and consistently deliver the highest quality products to our customers—first and fast.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Our brand portfolio includes Victor Allen’s®, Dutch Bros® beverages and Nurri™, our better-for-you protein beverage line.  We are passionate about beverages – and about building a team that’s just as energized.  We invite you to explore opportunities at Trilliant or Horseshoe, to see if your talents and career aspirations may fit with our openings.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif;color:black\"> </span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif;color:black\">Our Core Values:</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif;color:black\"></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif;color:black\"> </span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoHeading7\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Position Overview:</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">The Consumer Insights Manager will serve as a key strategic insights partner to assigned business units, translating consumer understanding into better decisions across brand strategy, innovation, portfolio development, activation, and growth.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">The role will also support the development and ongoing operation of the company's Consumer Insights capability, helping establish and maintain consistent research processes, methodologies, vendor partnerships, knowledge management, and learning agendas across the organization.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">This is a hands-on role requiring strong research expertise, business curiosity, and the ability to move beyond reporting findings to identify clear implications and recommended actions.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Responsibilities:</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Build & Optimize Consumer Insights </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.25in;text-indent:-0.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Develop and improve consumer insights processes, tools, and governance. </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.25in;text-indent:-0.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Manage research vendors, budgets, and project prioritization. </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.25in;text-indent:-0.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Create learning agendas aligned with business goals. </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.25in;text-indent:-0.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Leverage technology and AI to improve research efficiency and impact. </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Strategic Business Partnership </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.25in;text-indent:-0.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Serve as the consumer insights lead for assigned business units. </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.25in;text-indent:-0.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Partner with Marketing, Innovation, R&D, Sales, and leadership. </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.25in;text-indent:-0.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Identify consumer knowledge gaps and translate business challenges into research plans. </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Lead Consumer & Brand Research </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.25in;text-indent:-0.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Manage qualitative and quantitative research related to: </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.65in;text-indent:-0.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'courier new'\">o<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Consumer needs and behaviors </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.65in;text-indent:-0.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'courier new'\">o<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Segmentation and targeting </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.65in;text-indent:-0.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'courier new'\">o<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Brand positioning and equity </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.65in;text-indent:-0.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'courier new'\">o<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Consumer trends and decision journeys </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.65in;text-indent:-0.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'courier new'\">o<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Messaging, packaging, pricing, and value perception </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Support Innovation </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.25in;text-indent:-0.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Lead consumer research throughout the innovation lifecycle, from opportunity identification through post-launch evaluation. </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.25in;text-indent:-0.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Provide insights that shape and optimize product, packaging, claims, and pricing decisions. </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Drive Actionable Insights </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.25in;text-indent:-0.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Synthesize research into clear recommendations and business implications. </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.25in;text-indent:-0.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Present findings to stakeholders and senior leaders. </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.25in;text-indent:-0.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Connect consumer insights to brand, portfolio, and growth strategies. </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.25in;text-indent:-0.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Track the impact of insights on business decisions. </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\"> </span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Qualifications:</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.25in;text-indent:-0.25in;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:115%;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:115%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Approximately 5–8+ years of Consumer Insights, Market Research, or related experience.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.25in;text-indent:-0.25in;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:115%;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:115%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Bachelor’s degree in business or marketing required.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.25in;text-indent:-0.25in;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:115%;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:115%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Experience in CPG, food, beverage, nutrition, or another consumer-driven industry strongly preferred.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.25in;text-indent:-0.25in;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:115%;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:115%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Strong qualitative and quantitative research experience.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.25in;text-indent:-0.25in;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:115%;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:115%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Experience supporting brand strategy and innovation.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.25in;text-indent:-0.25in;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:115%;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:115%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Experience managing external research vendors and multiple concurrent research projects.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.25in;text-indent:-0.25in;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:115%;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:115%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Strong understanding of concept, product, packaging, claims, and consumer research methodologies.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.25in;text-indent:-0.25in;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:115%;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:115%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Strong analytical and synthesis capabilities.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.25in;text-indent:-0.25in;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:115%;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:115%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Ability to translate consumer research into clear business implications.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.25in;text-indent:-0.25in;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:115%;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:115%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Strong written and verbal communication skills.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.25in;text-indent:-0.25in;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:115%;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:115%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Ability to influence cross-functional stakeholders.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.25in;text-indent:-0.25in;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:115%;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:115%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Strong curiosity and commercial orientation.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.25in;text-indent:-0.25in;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:115%;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:115%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Comfortable operating in an evolving environment and helping build new processes and capabilities.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:0.25in;text-indent:-0.25in;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:115%;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:115%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Travel as required to Little Chute, WI.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\"> </span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Hours, Location and Pay:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">We offer a competitive base pay rate and benefits package for full-time employees.  This role works at our Little Chute, WI manufacturing facility or remotely with occasional travel to Little Chute, WI.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Physical and Mental Demands:</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-0.25in;line-height:normal;margin:0in 0in 0in 0.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">While performing the duties of this job, the employee is frequently required to sit, hear, use hands to type data, use a personal computer and telephone. This employee may occasionally have to operate business machines and lift and/move up to 50 pounds.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-0.25in;line-height:normal;margin:0in 0in 0in 0.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Specific vision abilities required in this job include close vision and the ability to adjust focus.  Reasonable accommodations may be made to enable individuals with disabilities to perform the essential functions.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-0.25in;line-height:normal;margin:0in 0in 0in 0.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Mental demands include multi-tasking, decision making, problem solving, comparing, copying, computing, compiling, analyzing, coordinating, and synthesizing data.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-0.25in;line-height:normal;margin:0in 0in 0in 0.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Potential for exposure to chemicals, heights, loud noises, mechanical equipment, wet environments, and other potential hazards exists.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:0in;background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Safety Statement:</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">At Trilliant and Horseshoe, safety is every employee’s first responsibility.  We expect all employees to adhere to all safety practices, have the moral courage to stop other individuals from performing unsafe acts, and immediately report unsafe conditions.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:107%;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Disclosures:</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-0.25in;line-height:normal;margin:0in 0in 0in 0.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">The above statements are intended to describe the general nature and level of work being performed by people assigned to this classification. They are not to be construed as an exhaustive list of all responsibilities, duties, and skills required of personnel so classified. All personnel may be required to perform duties outside of their normal responsibilities from time to time, as needed.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-0.25in;line-height:normal;margin:0in 0in 0in 0.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Responsible for following food safety/regulatory policies and procedures, executing responsibilities as identified in standard operating procedures, and reporting food safety/regulatory concerns to the Production or Quality Manager.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-0.25in;line-height:normal;margin:0in 0in 0in 0.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Trilliant Food & Nutrition and Horseshoe Beverage Company are Drug Free Workplaces. All applicants are subject to a drug screen and background check as a condition of employment.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-0.25in;line-height:normal;margin:0in 0in 0in 0.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Trilliant Food and Nutrition and Horseshoe Beverage participate in the E-Verify process.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-0.25in;line-height:normal;margin:0in 0in 0in 0.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">EEO/AA including Vets and Disabled</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-0.25in;line-height:normal;margin:0in 0in 0in 0.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">If you need a reasonable accommodation for any part of the employment process, please contact us by email at </span><a href=\"mailto:hr@example.com\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif;text-decoration:none\">hr@example.com</span></a><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\"> and let us know the nature of your request and your contact information.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-0.25in;line-height:normal;margin:0in 0in 0in 0.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">Trilliant Food and Nutrition and Horseshoe Beverage are Equal Opportunity Employers.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-0.25in;line-height:normal;margin:0in 0in 0in 0.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'symbol'\">·<span style=\"font:7pt 'times new roman'\">         </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'arial' , sans-serif\">The principles of the OECD and UN have been taken into consideration and used as guidance in our human rights practices and procedures.</span></p>"
